[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Audio Playback Subsystem Requirements
UID: YAAP-APSSR
DATE: @GIT_COMMIT_DATETIME
PREFIX: APSSR-

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Introduction

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document defines the system requirements for Yet Another Audio Player
(Yaap), a time accurate desktop audio player.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: File Handling

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: FLAC File Handling

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-001
TITLE: FLAC File Input Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall support FLAC files as audio input sources.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-002
TITLE: FLAC Format Identification
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall identify whether an input file contains an audio stream 
encoded in the FLAC format.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-009

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-003
TITLE: FLAC File Decoding
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall decode supported audio streams encoded in the FLAC format
into PCM audio samples.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-004
TITLE: FLAC File Channel Extraction
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall obtain the number of audio channels from FLAC audio
streams.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-005
TITLE: FLAC File Sample Rate Extraction
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall obtain the sample rate of FLAC audio streams.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-006
TITLE: FLAC File Bits Per Sample Extraction
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall obtain the number of bits per sample from FLAC audio 
streams.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-001

[[/SECTION]]

