[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Audio File Error Handling

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-051
TITLE: Unsupported Format Reporting
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall report when an input audio stream uses an unsupported
format or encoding.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-010

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-052
TITLE: Invalid Audio Data Reporting
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall report when an input audio stream contains invalid or
corrupted data that prevents decoding.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-011

