[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Local Audio Files

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Local Audio File Selection

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-053
TITLE: Local Audio File Selection Request
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall allow the user to initiate the selection of a local audio
file for playback.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-012

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-054
TITLE: Selected Local Audio File Provision
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall make selected local audio files available for playback.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-012

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Local Audio File Access

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-055
TITLE: Local Audio File Opening
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall open a selected local audio file for reading.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-013

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-056
TITLE: Local Audio File Reading
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall read data from an opened local audio file.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-013

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Local Audio File Playback Failure

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-057
TITLE: Local Audio File Opening Failure Reporting
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall report failures when opening a selected local audio file
for reading.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-014

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-058
TITLE: Local Audio File Reading Failure Reporting
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall report failures when reading an opened local audio file.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-014

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: APSSR-059
TITLE: Local Audio File Playback Failure Reporting
STATEMENT: >>>
The subsystem shall report failures when a selected local file cannot be
played.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SR-124

